{"id":"f04ebe4ce16b21f5","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-henkin-provable.md","title":"Henkin Sentence Provable","display":"thm-henkin-provable — Henkin Sentence Provable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-henkin-provable","aliases":["89-thm-henkin-provable"],"display":"thm-henkin-provable — Henkin Sentence Provable","depends_on":["[[89-df-henkin-sentence]]","[[89-thm-lob-theorem]]","[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","[[89-df-provable-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-henkin-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-henkin-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-henkin-provable — Henkin Sentence Provable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4cc05e68647fcda4\" href=\"?note=4cc05e68647fcda4\" title=\"89-df-henkin-sentence\">89-df-henkin-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"77b58358ab49cf8f\" href=\"?note=77b58358ab49cf8f\" title=\"89-thm-lob-theorem\">89-thm-lob-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9aca87310232fb2f\" href=\"?note=9aca87310232fb2f\" title=\"89-df-hilbert-bernays\">89-df-hilbert-bernays</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized theory extending PA.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is its provable-sentence set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}\\)</span> satisfies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathrm{Henkin}(T)\">\\(H\\in\\mathrm{Henkin}(T)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\\land H\\in\\mathrm{Henkin}(T)\n\\Longrightarrow\nH\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\\land H\\in\\mathrm{Henkin}(T)\n\\Longrightarrow\nH\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> : Henkin句子\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner H \\urcorner})\">\\(H \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner H \\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n<li>Henkin句子在其理论中可证</li>\n<li>与Gödel句子不可判定形成对比</li>\n<li>固定点定理的推论</li>\n<li>由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 的固定点等价得到\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\\to H\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\\to H\\)</span> 可证，再应用\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"77b58358ab49cf8f\" href=\"?note=77b58358ab49cf8f\" title=\"89-thm-lob-theorem\">89-thm-lob-theorem</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-henkin-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"4cc05e68647fcda4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"77b58358ab49cf8f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-lob-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-hilbert-bernays","status":"resolved","id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"77b58358ab49cf8f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"由 $H$ 的固定点等价得到\n$\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\\to H$ 可证，再应用\n[[89-thm-lob-theorem]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})","display":false},{"tex":"H\\in\\mathrm{Henkin}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\\land H\\in\\mathrm{Henkin}(T)\n\\Longrightarrow\nH\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"H \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner H \\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\\to H","display":false}],"bytes":1204,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-536","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-henk